{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46093","headline":"到蜀与郑中丞相遇 · 贯休","name":"到蜀与郑中丞相遇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"深隐犹爲未死灰，远寻知己遇三台。\n如何麋鹿群中出，又见鵷鸾天上来。\n劒阁霞黏残雪在，锦江香甚百花开。\n谩期王谢来相访，不是支公出世才。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46093.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46093","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}